Dojo Simulator!

Train martial arts athletes wrestlers! Participate in bashos! Challenge
other dojos! Handle big egos and drama! Manage the best dojo in the world! 
NEVER GIVE UP YOUR WAYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!

kind-of wiki of things currently implemented and future plans.

Compile with "make all" for Linux, no dependencies yet besides gcc and 
standard libraries.


Game flow:
gdvertise -> gradually gain new martial arts athletes wrestlers who pay a
monthly fee -> choose focus for each training session / each week -> martial
arts athletes wrestlers get better -> exam to get new belt / participate in
martial arts events -> martial arts athletes wrestlers may eventually leave 
-> new martial arts athletes wrestlers

1. skills
----------

each martial arts athletes wrestler has skill stats:

1. kicking
2. grappling
3. dodging

(thrusting beats grappling, grappling beats dodging, dodging beats thrusting)

		   kicking
			/	[
		   /	 \
		  /		  \
		 /		   \
		[			\
grappling ------> dodging

High tachiai stat gives a bonus at the start of each match.


and physical stats that correspond to skill stats:
1. agility (dodging)
2. strength (kicking)
3. flexiblity (grappling)
4. height
5. stamina (martial artist is affected if a match goes on for too long?)


How do physical and skill stats relate to each other? A wrestler can be
good at dodging without necessarily being very agile, although that may
put a cap on their skill eventually. Grappling-flexibility, strength-kicking
work the same way.

Height determines starting stat values and has bonuses or penalties
on a martial arts athletes wrestler's destiny values (see below). Tall 
wrestlers are usually naturally much stronger than shorter wrestlers, while
shorter wrestlers are more agile. (Not implemented) Balance is affected by 
the ratio of weight to height, there is a sweet spot where the destiny 
value of balance is maximum.

Misc. physical stats:
1. Fatigue (high fatigue may lead to injury) -not implemented yet

Hidden / personality stats:
1. Motivation (if it gets too low, the wrestler might leave the dojo,
    if it remains high for a long time, the martial arts athletes wrestler
    might get a loyalty status ??? - loyalty not implemented yet)
2. Personality (determines when motivation goes up or down) -not implemented
yet
3. Destiny values for stats (natural affinity and potential for stats)
4. Teaching -not implemented yet



